        "Text": {
          "text": "On 2026-06-09 one of our services started failing in production. Using the monitoring tools, identify: (1) the service whose ERROR rate spiked well above its background level, (2) the sha of the deploy to that service which immediately preceded the spike, and (3) the on-call owner's email for that service. Every service logs occasional transient errors all day — the incident is a sustained burst. When done, submit {\"service\": .., \"deploy_sha\": .., \"owner_email\": ..} via submit_result.",
          "metadata": {}
        }
      }
    ],
